<title>UK: Euromoney profits rise in year.</title>
<headline>Euromoney profits rise in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		75.93		  vs 49.87</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 32.00		  vs 29.50</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 46.00		  vs 43.50</p>
<p> Pretax		     25.50		  vs 18.22</p>
<p> Turnover		   104.28		 vs 116.23</p>
<p> Operating profit	 21.96		  vs 15.28</p>
<p> Profit retained	  6.79		   vs 1.34</p>
<p>NOTE - Euromoney Publications Plc is a publisher and exhibitions group.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
